==Battleground==
*10 [[Metal Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*5 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Sir Metal Seal]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Metal Doge]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**3 [[Super Metal Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 46.67~50 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,500f</sup>.
**4 [[Loris|Lorises]] spawn, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage's difficulty comes from the Loris stack wreaking havoc on your crit and proc units. The best way to avoid this is to fight near the enemy base, so Loris tends to miss its attack. Bringing wave or long distance units can also help on chipping the Lorises down and even push them towards the base. If those aren't a option, however, research combos for critters will suffice.

You can use the Ironwall cat cannon to keep the enemies behind the base when the boss shockwave comes, which allows your units to evade the Loris stack by fighting inside their blindspots.

